@startuml as-is
' AS-IS process as a UML activity diagram (the requirements accept BPMN or
' UML activity). Save the render as as-is.png here.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

|Reader|
start
:Remember an idea from a book;
repeat
  :Guess keywords the author may have used;
  :Guess which book holds the passage;
  :Open the book in a reader app;
  :Search inside this one book;
  if (Passage found?) then (yes)
    :Read the passage;
    stop
  else (no)
  endif
repeat while (Try other words or another book?) is (yes)
->no;
:Search the web or give up;
stop
@enduml
